{"id":"c8026e52a7730811","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-jonsson-chain.md","title":"Jónsson Chain","display":"df-jonsson-chain — Jónsson Chain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-jonsson-chain","aliases":["93-df-jonsson-chain"],"display":"df-jonsson-chain — Jónsson Chain","depends_on":["[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-equation]]","[[93-df-equational-class]]","[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-variable]]","[[93-df-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-jonsson-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-jonsson-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jonsson-chain — Jónsson Chain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8e602c19b2984096\" href=\"?note=8e602c19b2984096\" title=\"93-df-substitution\">93-df-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{93}_3=\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_3)=\\{v_0,v_1,v_2\\}\">\\(X^{93}_3=\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_3)=\\{v_0,v_1,v_2\\}\\)</span> is the canonical three-variable set, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> is a class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-algebras.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\\)</span> are sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the sourced similarity-type predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\\)</span> is the type-indexed variety predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma^{\\tau}\\)</span> are the substitution predicate and its term extension from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8e602c19b2984096\" href=\"?note=8e602c19b2984096\" title=\"93-df-substitution\">93-df-substitution</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{93}_3\">\\(X^{93}_3\\)</span>, the three displayed substitutions, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\nX^{93}_3\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_3),\\qquad\n\\sigma^{93}_{xyx}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_1,v_1\\rangle,\\langle v_2,v_0\\rangle\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\nX^{93}_3\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar v_3),\\qquad\n\\sigma^{93}_{xyx}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_1,v_1\\rangle,\\langle v_2,v_0\\rangle\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\sigma^{93}_{xxz}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_1,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_2,v_2\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\sigma^{93}_{xzz}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_1,v_2\\rangle,\\langle v_2,v_2\\rangle\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\sigma^{93}_{xxz}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_1,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_2,v_2\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\sigma^{93}_{xzz}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_1,v_2\\rangle,\\langle v_2,v_2\\rangle\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma^{93}_{xyx};\\tau,X^{93}_3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma^{93}_{xxz};\\tau,X^{93}_3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma^{93}_{xzz};\\tau,X^{93}_3)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma^{93}_{xyx};\\tau,X^{93}_3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma^{93}_{xxz};\\tau,X^{93}_3)\n\\land\\mathrm{Sub}_{93}(\\sigma^{93}_{xzz};\\tau,X^{93}_3)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}(\\mathcal V,s,t;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}(s,t;\\tau,X)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\\langle s,t\\rangle\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}(\\mathcal V,s,t;\\tau,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}(s,t;\\tau,X)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\\langle s,t\\rangle\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}(\\bar d,n,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\bar d:n+1\\to T_{\\tau}(X^{93}_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}(\\mathcal V,\\bar d(0),v_0;\\tau,X^{93}_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}(\\mathcal V,\\bar d(n),v_2;\\tau,X^{93}_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\le n\\;\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathcal V,\n\\widehat{\\sigma^{93}_{xyx}}^{\\tau}(\\bar d(i)),v_0;\\tau,X^{93}_3\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(i\\equiv0\\pmod 2\\to\n\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathcal V,\n\\widehat{\\sigma^{93}_{xxz}}^{\\tau}(\\bar d(i)),\n\\widehat{\\sigma^{93}_{xxz}}^{\\tau}(\\bar d(i+1));\\tau,X^{93}_3\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\n\\bigl(i\\equiv1\\pmod 2\\to\n\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathcal V,\n\\widehat{\\sigma^{93}_{xzz}}^{\\tau}(\\bar d(i)),\n\\widehat{\\sigma^{93}_{xzz}}^{\\tau}(\\bar d(i+1));\\tau,X^{93}_3\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jonsson\\text{-}chain}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{JonssonChain}_{93}(\\bar d,n,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\bar d:n+1\\to T_{\\tau}(X^{93}_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}(\\mathcal V,\\bar d(0),v_0;\\tau,X^{93}_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}(\\mathcal V,\\bar d(n),v_2;\\tau,X^{93}_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\le n\\;\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathcal V,\n\\widehat{\\sigma^{93}_{xyx}}^{\\tau}(\\bar d(i)),v_0;\\tau,X^{93}_3\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(i\\equiv0\\pmod 2\\to\n\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathcal V,\n\\widehat{\\sigma^{93}_{xxz}}^{\\tau}(\\bar d(i)),\n\\widehat{\\sigma^{93}_{xxz}}^{\\tau}(\\bar d(i+1));\\tau,X^{93}_3\\bigr)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\n\\bigl(i\\equiv1\\pmod 2\\to\n\\mathrm{EqValid}_{93}\\bigl(\\mathcal V,\n\\widehat{\\sigma^{93}_{xzz}}^{\\tau}(\\bar d(i)),\n\\widehat{\\sigma^{93}_{xzz}}^{\\tau}(\\bar d(i+1));\\tau,X^{93}_3\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The predicate includes the finite index, term typing, ambient variety, and every Jónsson identity. Repeated variables in the traditional notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_i(x,y,x)\">\\(d_i(x,y,x)\\)</span> are represented by explicit endomorphisms of the canonical term algebra, not by treating a syntactic term as a metalinguistic function.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"ca7404158049be33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1e2cbe43bd24f67f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equational-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"11b62d0ad578fa42","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"8e602c19b2984096","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","locat